Package: mscos-dsd-dkms
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: mescon <mescon@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/mescon/mscOS
Depends: dkms, git, patch, ca-certificates
Description: mscOS: native DSD for C-Media CM6632A USB receivers (DKMS)
 Builds snd-usb-audio with the mscOS patch for the running kernel: raw DSD in a 64-bit
 subslot, as used by the Mark Levinson No585 and No585.5. Fetches sound/usb of the
 matching upstream kernel release when building. Not needed on mscOS images, whose
 kernel already has the patch. Needs the kernel headers of the running kernel.
